#
# The command line tools CI runs over the repository and the registry template: JSON Schema
# validation and REUSE licence lint (security review SC-3). ci-lint-requirements.txt pins them and
# their dependency chains with PyPI hashes (refresh like ci-sim-requirements.in).
#
# reuse publishes a source archive only (its one wheel is built for glibc 2.41 and CPython 3.10, which
# no runner has), so the jobs install with --no-binary reuse: pip checks the source archive's hash,
# then builds it; the build backend (poetry-core) comes unpinned from PyPI, build time only.
check-jsonschema
reuse
